{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41901","headline":"秋江夜泊寄刘钧正字 · 李中","name":"秋江夜泊寄刘钧正字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲忆诗人思倍劳，维舟清夜泥风骚。\n鱼龙不动澄江远，云雾皆收皎月高。\n潮满钓舟迷浦屿，霜繁野树叫猨猱。\n此时吟苦君知否，双鬓从他有二毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}